EN:
Hey, maaaann, how 'bout this time?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Can I get that scallop?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yeah, I guess you can.
Get a job!

IT:
Ehi squalett{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}! E questa volta?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi dai la tua capasanta?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Massì, tieni...
Trovatene una!

TRANSLATION:
Hey dostum, bu kez olur mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Şu deniz tarağını bana verir misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Peki, al.
Git çalış da kazan!
